# Data Model — Yield Vault

## Entities

### Entity: Vault

An ERC-4626 compliant vault that accepts deposits and manages yield strategies.

```yaml
entity: Vault
type: contract
properties:
  address:
    type: string
    required: true
  underlying:
    type: string
    required: true
  name:
    type: string
    required: true
  symbol:
    type: string
    required: true
  totalAssets:
    type: number
    required: true
  performanceFee:
    type: number
    required: true
states: [initialized, active, paused, emergency]
lifecycle: initialized → active → paused → emergency
```

### Entity: Strategy

A yield-generating strategy that deploys vault capital.

```yaml
entity: Strategy
type: contract
properties:
  address:
    type: string
    required: true
  name:
    type: string
    required: true
  apy:
    type: number
    required: true
  tvl:
    type: number
    required: true
  risk:
    type: enum
    values: [low, medium, high]
    required: true
states: [proposed, active, harvesting, closed]
lifecycle: proposed → active → harvesting → closed
```

### Entity: Deposit

A user deposit into the vault.

```yaml
entity: Deposit
type: event
properties:
  user:
    type: string
    format: address
    required: true
  amount:
    type: number
    required: true
  shares:
    type: number
    required: true
  timestamp:
    type: number
    required: true
states: [pending, confirmed]
lifecycle: pending → confirmed
```

### Entity: Withdrawal

A user withdrawal from the vault.

```yaml
entity: Withdrawal
type: event
properties:
  user:
    type: string
    format: address
    required: true
  shares:
    type: number
    required: true
  amount:
    type: number
    required: true
  timestamp:
    type: number
    required: true
states: [pending, queued, completed]
lifecycle: pending → queued → completed
```

### Entity: Share

ERC-20 token representing proportional ownership of vault assets.

```yaml
entity: Share
type: contract
properties:
  address:
    type: string
    required: true
  totalSupply:
    type: number
    required: true
  pricePerShare:
    type: number
    required: true
states: [active]
lifecycle: active → active
```

## Relationships

### Relationship: Vault → Strategy

```yaml
relationship: Vault -> Strategy
verb: deploys
cardinality: 1:N
required: true
description: Vault deploys capital into one or more strategies
```

### Relationship: Vault → Share

```yaml
relationship: Vault -> Share
verb: mints
cardinality: 1:1
required: true
description: Vault mints shares on deposit
```

### Relationship: Vault → Deposit

```yaml
relationship: Vault -> Deposit
verb: receives
cardinality: 1:N
required: true
description: Vault receives user deposits
```

### Relationship: Strategy → Vault

```yaml
relationship: Strategy -> Vault
verb: returns
cardinality: N:1
required: true
description: Strategy returns yield to vault
```
